    gpu_probe_then_create_toctou_2026-08-04, 1, "2026-11-26 gpuvk lane, linux-aarch64 GB10 real Vulkan+CUDA, seed fb80903917d6d5f5: toctou spec 3/3 (also at ulimit -n 44); parity spec 17/17 device_readback x3 at ulimit -n 44; CREATE_FAULT=vulkan and PROBE_FAULT=vulkan both 17/17 with GPU BRANCH SKIPPED disclosure (no vacuous green); cuda_strict 26/26 under both knobs. Resolver-disagree defect split to web_engine2d_two_backend_resolvers_disagree_2026-11-26."
    gpu_probe_then_create_toctou_2026-08-04, 2, "2026-11-26 correction: verified withdrawn. vulkan_strict_spec was still prediction-gated (17/19 under SIMPLE_2D_CREATE_FAULT=vulkan) and is fixed here (19/19). Sabotage device_identity=0 makes parity 14/17 and vulkan_strict 11/19. Three siblings are blocked by transplant damage (toctou_sibling_specs_broken_by_release_transplant_88aac2ffe28_2026-11-26); the cuda knob is not shown to reach cuda_strict."
    gpu_probe_then_create_toctou_2026-08-04, 3, "2026-11-26 review follow-up: REQ-VKSTRICT-010 no longer probe-gated; SIMPLE_2D_REQUIRE_VULKAN=1 turns a failed strict create into a failure (CREATE_FAULT+REQUIRE: 16/19 rc=1; REQUIRE alone 19/19). Claim released, not done."

